 are closed 
\begin_inset Formula $\iff$
\end_inset

 
\begin_inset Formula $V(y)$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $V(x)$
\end_inset

 are open.
 Take 
\begin_inset Formula $y^{\prime}\in V(y)$
\end_inset

.
 Then, 
\begin_inset Formula $y^{\prime}\succ z$
\end_inset

.
 Take 
\begin_inset Formula $x^{\prime}\in V(x)$
\end_inset

.
 Then, 
\begin_inset Formula $z\succ x^{\prime}$
\end_inset

.
 By transitivity of 
