\begin_layout Proof
\begin_inset space \quad{}
\end_inset

Assume 
\begin_inset Formula $R$
\end_inset

 is continuous.
 Then, by Theorem 9 (Debreu's Representation Theorem), 
\begin_inset Formula $R$
\end_inset

