\begin_inset Formula $\succsim$
\end_inset

 is monotone, then 
\begin_inset Formula $\hat{x}\gg y\implies\hat{x}\succ y$
\end_inset

.
 But, 
\begin_inset Formula $ $
\end_inset

this contradicts the fact that 
\begin_inset Formula $y\succ\hat{x}$
\end_inset

 
\begin_inset Formula $(\rightarrow\leftarrow)$
\end_inset

.
